{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "31", "m": "07", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "08", "M": "29", "S": "51"}}, "news": [{"title": "Mhada gets three land parcels in Nashik to help build homes for about 200 families", "para": "Maharashtra Housing Authority received surplus land for affordable housing. This land will accommodate nearly two hundred lower-income families in Nashik. The district administration transferred the land at a nominal rate of one rupee. Mhada must initiate the housing project within three years of possession. This initiative aims to boost affordable housing options for many residents.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/mhada-secures-land-for-affordable-housing-in-nashik-for-200-families/132754762?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-928306/132754762.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Hingoli to mandate earthquake-resistant homes, including those under PMAY, in seismic zones", "para": "Hingoli district will mandate earthquake-resistant construction for all new homes. This includes houses built under the Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana scheme. The administration seeks technical guidance from CBRI for building norms. Local masons and construction workers are receiving training in new techniques. Existing homeowners will also be encouraged to retrofit their properties.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/hingoli-to-mandate-earthquake-resistant-homes-including-those-under-pmay-in-seismic-zones/132754725?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1768158/132754725.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "New Noida land acquisition begins in August, 40% area earmarked for industries", "para": "Noida Authority begins land acquisition for New Noida in August.  Le